      {
        "name": "places/ChIJ100bTj8BBDQREDE0SrP--Y4/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25vMU9WcFBYemxFWVVsSVkwOVpSek41TkdsSlpHYxAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "9 個月前",
        "rating": 3,
        "text": {
          "text": "聽講好出名，所以想嚟試吓🥳\n價錢合理🐒\n但係真心冇話特別好飲🤡\n但係我亦都講唔出香港有咩抹茶飲品舖係10分😀\n全部嘢都係即叫即整，所以等候時間比較較長🙂‍↕️",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
